{"mode":"writing_context","taskScope":{"operation":"write","targetResourceRefs":[],"requiredWriteResourceRefs":[],"memoryUpdateRequired":false,"memoryScopeBound":false,"memoryParticipantCount":null,"participantCharacterRefs":["character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye"],"participantScopeFixed":true,"requiredReadResourceRefs":["character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","world:lore","outline:master","outline:hierarchy","style:memory","chapter:chapter-001.md"],"intentBinding":{"version":2,"status":"bound","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","participantSelection":"all","participantRequestQuote":"请先读取六人的角色设定、世界观、大纲、文风和前章，","perspectiveRequestQuote":"以林岚为第三人称有限视角，","reviewAspects":["character","world","timeline","viewpoint"]},"chapterWritePolicy":"new","resourceWritePolicy":"any","initialChapterResourceRefs":["chapter:chapter-001.md"],"writeScopeBound":true,"atomicMemoryWithChapter":false,"preserveOriginalMemories":false,"wordCountScope":"new_writing","wordCountResourceRefs":[],"allowedWriteResourceRefs":[],"allowResourceDeletion":false,"minBodyCjk":1500,"maxBodyCjk":2000,"wordCountToleranceRatio":0,"completionEvidence":["bodyChineseCharacterCount","resourceHashes"],"prohibitRepetition":false,"requiresCompleteEnding":false,"reviewRequired":true,"narrativeAuditRequired":true,"narrativePerspective":{"mode":"limited","focusCharacterRef":"character:lin"},"repairRequired":true,"reviewScope":"saved_resources","reviewTargetResourceRefs":[],"reviewSourceKinds":["character","style","world"],"reviewScopeBound":true},"sharedSources":[{"resourceRef":"world:lore","kind":"world","mode":"content","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","offset":0,"content":"# 雾港世界设定
## 地理与时间
雾港为潮汐岛城，北岸旧渡口、中央钟楼、东侧封桥、西侧灯塔诊所。当前为秋汛第六日，阴雨、能见度不足两百米。所有时间用二十四小时制。
旧渡口到灯塔水路四十分钟，步行绕北堤九十分钟；钟楼到渡口步行十五分钟。不存在瞬移、飞行、瞬间传信。
封桥时间为21:00，封桥只关闭东桥，不关闭水路；渡船仍须执照和通行证。
低潮始于20:30，碎石滩不可拖曳重船；正规航道可航行但不得缩短四十分钟。
## 制度
冷藏药出港须巡港队长与医师各盖一印，缺一不可。议事厅文书的公文不能代替医师签字。
居民不允许强行搜身，须经队长立案和当事人见证；拘捕不能仅凭怀疑。
潮钟只是公共时钟，不控制潮水、封桥和天气；校时须与机械怀表及潮表两种来源核对。
## 技术与物资
只有机械钟、油灯、纸张、蒸汽冷柜，无电报、手机、监控或魔法。船用手摇绞盘，不存在自动驾驶。
药箱铅封完整，开启外箱会破坏铅封；暗格可在保持铅封时滑出，但外人看不出位置。冷藏药离开冰柜后只能保存六十分钟。
蓝签账页只是旧账证据，不能凭一页直接定罪。证据需核对年月、页码、签章。
## 信仰与信息边界
灯塔守夜人相信海雾会记住名字，这是信仰而非客观超能力。
角色私密信息不自动共享；只有在场听到或看到具体证据才能成为角色已知事实。
第1章结束于20:05，六人刚在旧渡口集齐，所有人尚未启航。何芷未说出暗格，林岚未说出七分钟。
"},{"resourceRef":"outline:master","kind":"outline","mode":"content","hash":"7e36c4d2b0d88a30c85b2752e9c71f543e23e88d6de3f0189bfd6c2a97a3ea91","offset":0,"content":"# 总纲
六人在封桥前运送冷藏药，因时间、程序和隐藏的账页相互试探。最终依据证据达成有限信任。不得一次揭开所有秘密。
第二章20:05—20:20，林岚视角，在渡口完成双印和是否启航的决定，不必抵达灯塔。
第三章紧接第二章，用角色主观动机推动阻力、选择与后果。"},{"resourceRef":"outline:hierarchy","kind":"outline","mode":"content","hash":"afa14801b02d4436f28503d2a4c6af9af8a42e0d462735bf239d0879134291f0","offset":0,"content":"{
